  "name": "create-task-and-sequence",
  "description": "A change set across the `tasks` and `sequences` layers: a new task carrying its runnable mapping in the create payload, and the sequence scenario that visualizes it. Four cross-layer rules are checked in one deterministic pass over the staged result instead of by four per-tool pre-checks.",
